{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"printf '\\\\n[sol] 2026-10-22: Core reduces to 0<=p_i<=v_i and sum p>=v_P; F is capped simplex sum p=v_P (nonnegative values). Complement x=v-p gives sum x=D=sum v-v_P, caps v. Conjectured clean equality classification: all three winner values equal, OR v_P<=min(v_i), OR v_P>=sum(v_i)-min(v_i); mixed regimes should strictly fail. Investigating proof and zero-value degeneracies.\\\\n' >> /work/board.md; ls /work/logs\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
